---@field MAXIMUM? aws.gamelift.WholeNumber The maximum instance count value allowed.
---@field PENDING? aws.gamelift.WholeNumber Number of instances that are starting but not yet active.
---@field ACTIVE? aws.gamelift.WholeNumber Actual number of instances that are ready to host game sessions.
---@field IDLE? aws.gamelift.WholeNumber Number of active instances that are not currently hosting a game session.
---@field TERMINATING? aws.gamelift.WholeNumber Number of instances that are no longer active but haven't yet been terminated.

